  "question": {
    "text": "Let the abscissae of the two points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;be the roots of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and the ordinates of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> be the roots of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If the equation of the circle described on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;as diameter is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the roots of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and roots of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p>Equation of the circle with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;as diameter will be&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>On&nbsp;comparing with the given equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
